// Salow Medium: a smaller, faster Salow (3 network layers instead of 4, about 22% less GPU time).
// Same extra steps as Salow: thin dark lines in dim areas at Anime4K A+A's depth, and frame-memory steadying
// against codec-noise shimmer on line edges. Slightly less close to A+A than Salow on fine edges.
// Needs vo=gpu-next (libplacebo). Memory texture covers 1920x1080; outside it steadying is off.
// Layer layout, Clamp_Highlights statistics and the starting weights come from Anime4K
// (https://github.com/bloc97/Anime4K), used under its MIT License:
//
// MIT License
